     id==guest_sysreg(3,0,0,5,0)||id==guest_sysreg(3,0,0,5,1)||
     id==guest_sysreg(3,0,0,6,0)||id==guest_sysreg(3,0,0,6,1)||id==guest_sysreg(3,0,0,6,2)||
